OL,3,GNEWSAFears for lido's future over pool
OL,4,Abreak-ins
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of break-ins pose a risk to a
OL,7,FWest Sussex lido's future, following
OL,8,Fdamage to the site over the summer and
OL,9,Fpending maintenance costs, the
OL,10,Fattraction's management says.
OL,12,FArundel Lido has been the subject of
OL,13,Frepeated break-ins in the evenings by
OL,14,Fyoung people wanting to swim, which has
OL,15,Falso seen the cover to the pool
OL,16,Fdamaged.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
