OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFears for lido's future over pool
OL,4,Abreak-ins
OL,5,
OL,6,FNikki Richardson, the lido's manager,
OL,7,Fsaid incidents such as the break-ins,
OL,8,Fon top of general running costs, put
OL,9,Fthe future of the site in jeopardy, as
OL,10,Fwell as posing safety risks for the
OL,11,Fyoung people breaking in.
OL,13,FShe said: "Our worst fear is a staff
OL,14,Fmember arriving in the morning and
OL,15,Ffinding a dead body."
